' F6 -- Component view of the deployed system.
' Chapter 4. UML component diagram.
' Claim supported: production runs FIVE containers. The LiteLLM gateway was
' removed on 2026-08-25 (docker-compose.prod.yml:55-70); LLM traffic always
' bypassed it. Database access is dual-mode.
' Corrected 2026-09-10 per docs/thesis/EVIDENCE_VERIFIED.md C1 -- the earlier
' revision drew six containers and showed the gateway as still deployed.
@startuml f6-components
!include _style.iuml

title Component view (as deployed, five containers)

skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Student /\nProfessor" as U

package "Hetzner CX23 -- Docker, single bridge network" {
  component "**frontend**\nnginx 1.27\nstatic Vite bundle\nreverse-proxies /api/" as FE
  component "**api**\nFastAPI\nuvicorn --workers 1" as API
  component "**worker**\nArq, max_jobs = 4" as WK
  database "**redis**\ncache\nallkeys-lru" as RC
  queue "**redis-queue**\nbroker + pubsub\nnoeviction + AOF" as RQ
}

cloud "**Supabase** (managed)\nPostgres 15 + pgvector\nAuth · Storage · PostgREST" as SB
cloud "**LLM providers**\nCerebras · Groq · Google\nMistral · OpenRouter\nCloudflare · OpenAI" as LLM

U --> FE : HTTPS / SSE
U --> SB : auth + direct reads

FE --> API : proxy /api/ (prefix **not** stripped)

API --> RC
API --> RQ : enqueue, ZCARD depth,\nsubscribe parse:<hash>
WK  --> RQ : consume,\npublish parse:<hash>
WK  --> RC

API --> SB : PostgREST over HTTPS\n(sync, threadpool)
API ..> SB : direct Postgres (asyncpg)\n//only if DATABASE_URL set//
WK  --> SB

API --> LLM : direct HTTPS
WK  --> LLM : direct HTTPS

note right of LLM
  **Called directly, and always were.**
  A sixth container -- a LiteLLM gateway -- ran here
  until 2026-08-25 with zero live callers, consuming
  1 GB / 0.75 vCPU of a 4 GB / 2 vCPU host while
  gating api + worker startup via depends_on:
  service_healthy. Removed in
  docker-compose.prod.yml:55-70.

  README.md:42 and GDPR_DATA_PROTECTION.md:23 still
  claim LLM traffic flows through it. It never did.
end note

note bottom of SB
  Dual access path. Without DATABASE_URL there is no
  asyncpg pool, yet /health/ready returns 200 with
  database = "not_configured" (main.py:360) while
  MV refresh, localization and the review engine
  are non-functional.
end note

legend bottom
  Solid = live data path.  Dashed = conditional dependency.
endlegend

@enduml
